    "audio": "Muted native decoding/time/seek/placement establishes the named technical behavior only. No input record establishes an audible-quality or pronunciation session.",
    "people": "No input record establishes observed uncoached ordinary-listener usability. Q11 and other U requirements retain their status.",
    "os": "The desktop record observes minimize/restore only; drag/context remain unverified. Private-credential records establish named OS storage operations with dummy entries, not broad OS acceptance. MediaSession callbacks, synthetic blur and Date/scheduler adapters are not physical hardware/app-switch/sleep evidence.",
